---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { href } from '../lib/paths';
import { SOURCE_URL } from '../lib/status';

const title = 'About Cappadocia Balloon Status';
const description =
  'Where the Cappadocia balloon flight status on this site comes from, how often it is checked, and its limits.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>About this site</h1>
  <p>
    Cappadocia Balloon Status answers one question for visitors: will the balloons fly this morning? It reads the public
    status page of the <a href={SOURCE_URL} rel="nofollow">Kapadokya Slot Service Center</a>, where the official flight
    flags are published, and shows them in plain language with times converted to Türkiye time.
  </p>

  <h2>How often it checks</h2>
  <p>
    Every 15 minutes between 04:00 and 12:00 Türkiye time, when the morning decisions are made, and once an hour
    otherwise. Each change is recorded on the <a href={href('/history/')}>history page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Limits</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This is an unofficial page and is not affiliated with the DGCA (SHGM), Kapadokya University or any operator.</li>
    <li>A green flag allows take-off, but your pilot and balloon company still make the final decision.</li>
    <li>Between checks the official status may already have changed. Your operator has the latest word.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
